The most recent BMW 745e is from the G11/G12 facelift generation, produced from 2019 to 2022. It was available in both standard (G11) and long wheelbase (G12, badged 745Le) versions, with RWD and AWD (xDrive) options depending on the market and model year. The US market primarily received the long-wheelbase xDrive model (745Le xDrive).

